{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AD2D": "「光龍の念に反応しているのか……！？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AD67": "「メディウス・ロクス……/　かわせたとは言え、油断は出来ない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00ADC3": "「いったん離脱するしかないか……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00ADF7": "「このままでは的になってしまう……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AE2E": "「慎重に攻撃を行わなければ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AE62": "「ロストしたか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AE84": "「再捕捉しなければ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AEAC": "「こちらの間合いを読まれたか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AEE3": "「こちらイング。援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AF0E": "「まだ僕がいる……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AF30": "「こちらからも……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AF52": "「逃げられると思うな……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AF7D": "「その隙は逃がさない……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AFA8": "「リョウト少尉、援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AFD3": "「リョウト少尉、後は僕が」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00AFFB": "「援護します、リオ少尉」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B020": "「リオ少尉、後は任せて下さい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B04E": "「アリエイルさん、援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B07C": "「後は引き受けます、アリエイルさん」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B0B3": "「マイ、後は僕が」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B0CF": "「ジョッシュさん、援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B0FD": "「リムさん、援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B122": "「援護します、ライディース少尉」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B153": "「イルム中尉、後は任せて下さい」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B184": "「援護します、リュウセイ少尉」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B1B2": "「ヒューゴ少尉、後は僕が」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B1DA": "「アクア少尉、援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B202": "「アヤ大尉、援護します」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B227": "「ヴィレッタ大尉、後は僕が」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B252": "「やらせはしない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B271": "「僕が受け止めます！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B293": "「ここは僕に任せて、離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B2C1": "「防いでみせる！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B2DD": "「僕に出来ることをする！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B305": "「リョウト少尉、離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B32D": "「リオ少尉、下がってください！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B35E": "「アリエイルさん、離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B389": "「マイ、下がって！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B3A8": "「後退して下さい、ジョッシュさん！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B3DF": "「リムさん、危ない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B401": "「イルム中尉、すぐに離脱を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B42F": "「ライディース少尉、離脱して下さい！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B469": "「その並びならば！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B488": "「一気に攻撃する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B4A7": "「まとめて叩く！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B4C3": "「これも受けてもらう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B4E5": "「まだ行ける……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B504": "「もう一度、行くぞ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B526": "「くらえ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B539": "「当てる！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B54C": "「スプリット・ビームキャノン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B57D": "「そこだ！　スプリット・ビームキャノン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B5BD": "「ブレード・トンファー、セット！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B5F1": "「ブースト・オン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B610": "「シーケンス、ＢＴ５！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B635": "「加速！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B645": "「ここはトンファーで！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B66A": "「踏み込む！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B680": "「はあああっ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B69C": "「うおおおおっ！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B6BB": "「グラビトン・ライフル！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B6E3": "「シュート！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/123.bmd|0x00B6F9": "「このＵＨＢＭで！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Mess